            "description": "### **interaction_partners**\n\n**Use-case:** Retrieve only **direct neighbors** of the protein (simpler, faster).\n\n```\nhttps://string-db.org/api/tsv/interaction_partners\n    ?identifier=STRING_ID\n    &species=TAXID\n    &limit=100\n\n ```\n\n✔ Best for “1-hop neighborhood visualizations”  \n✔ Great for simple side panels (list of partners)"
          },
          "response": []
        },
