            "description": "### **interaction_evidence**\n\n**Use-case:** Retrieve evidence categories for a specific pair.\n\n```\nhttps://string-db.org/api/tsv/interaction_evidence\n    ?identifiers=ID1\nID2\n    &species=TAXID\n\n ```\n\nReturns columns like:\n\n- experiments\n    \n- curated databases\n    \n- text mining\n    \n- co-occurrence\n    \n- co-expression\n    \n- homology\n    \n\n✔ Use this to populate the “Evidence breakdown” panel  \n✔ Perfect for edge tooltips or info popovers"
